  "what_this_is": [
    "The ONE registered full-corpus run named in DESIGN-sans-template-rendering §10. R0's parse table, R1's round-trip rate over the parseable denominator, R2's corpus-scale sweep, R5's surface digest, and the three blind controls C-R1..C-R3.",
    "It is byte-reproducible: no timestamp, no elapsed time, no absolute path. The C-R1 derangement is seeded from the committed lexicon's own digest and C-R2's mutation choice is the first applicable node in a fixed pre-order walk.",
    "It refuses to exist if C-R3 fails. The digest revalidation runs before a single term is realized."
  ],
